      "query": "{\"content\": \"P(grant) 0.15. The prior-Term salience band for a baseline paid petition is ~5.7% (Term 2024 bracketed figure). I adjust this up significantly because the case involves a major copyright issue (whether termination of a copyright grant reverts worldwide rights) and has drawn five major amici at the cert stage, including the MPA and RIAA, as well as being litigated by Paul Clement. However, I adjust down from what might otherwise be a very high probability because this is the first ci",
