      "params_digest": "dcf5fe0bfb2f8331",
      "query": "{\"content\": \"Distributed once so far; expect perhaps one relist as the Court considers the heavy amicus presence and economic stakes, but ultimately a denial. The lack of a circuit split strongly counsels against early intervention, and the Court is likely to wait for further percolation on this novel copyright termination issue. A CVSG is possible given the Berne Convention arguments, but unlikely since the US government is not a party and lower courts have barely touched the issue. If granted,",
